  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tonga Economic and Public Sector Reform Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The third iteration of Australia&apos;s Economic and Public Sector Governance Program supports a medium-term program of reforms to strengthen revenue, effectively manage government expenditure, reduce debt and promote private sector growth through performance-linked budget support, technical assistance and training. Policy dialogue, linked to budget support, is undertaken primarily through the Joint Policy Reform Matrix, together with the World Bank, Asian Development Bank, New Zealand Ministry of Foreign Affairs and Trade and the European Union.</narrative>
  </description>
